    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "If L ⃗ and P ⃗ represent the angular momentum and linear momentum respectively of a particle of mass ' m ' having position vector as r ⃗ = a ( i ˆ cos ⁡ ω t + j ˆ sin ⁡ ω t ) . The direction of force is",
