    "questionEn": "A person travelling on a straight line moves with a uniform velocity v 1 for a distance x and with a uniform velocity v 2 for the next 3 2 x distance. The average velocity in this motion is 50 7 m / s . If v 1 is 5 m / s then v 2 = __________ m / s .",
