    "questionEn": "A small bob of mass 100 mg and charge + 10 μ C is connected to an insulating string of length 1 m . It is brought near to an infinitely long non-conducting sheet of charge density ' σ ' as shown in figure. If string subtends an angle of 45 ∘ with the sheet at equilibrium the charge density of sheet will be. (Given, ε 0 = 8.85 × 10 − 12 F m and acceleration due to gravity, g = 10 m s 2 )",
