    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "A vessel with square cross-section and height of 6 m is vertically partitioned. A small window of 100 cm 2 with hinged door is fitted at a depth of 3 m in the partition wall. One part of the vessel is filled completely with water and the other side is filled with the liquid having density 1.5 × 10 3 kg / m 3 . What force one needs to apply on the hinged door so that it does not get opened ? (Acceleration due to gravity = 10 m / s 2 )",
