    "questionEn": "0.1 M solution of KI reacts with excess of H 2 SO 4 and KIO 3 solutions. According to equation 5 I − + IO − 3 + 6 H + → 3 I 2 + 3 H 2 O Identify the correct statements : (A) 200 mL of KI solution reacts with 0.004 mol of KIO 3 (B) 200 mL of KI solution reacts with 0.006 mol of H 2 SO 4 (C) 0.5 L of KI solution produced 0.005 mol of I 2 (D) Equivalent weight of KIO 3 is equal to ( Molecular weight 5 ) Choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
