    "questionEn": "A current of 5 A exists in a square loop of side 1 √ 2 m . Then the magnitude of the magnetic field B at the centre of the square loop will be p × 10 − 6 T . where, value of p is ________ [ Take μ 0 = 4 π × 10 − 7 T mA − 1 ].",
