    "questionEn": "The effect of temperature on spontaneity of reactions are represented as : | ΔH | ΔS | Temperature | Spontaneity | (A) | + | − | any T | Non spontaneous | (B) | + | + | low T | spontaneous | (C) | − | − | low T | Non spontaneous | (D) | − | + | any T | spontaneous | The incorrect combinations are :",
