    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "The energy of a system is given as E ( t ) = α 3 e − β t , where t is the time and β = 0.3 s − 1 . The errors in the measurement of α and t are 1.2 % and 1.6 % , respectively. At t = 5 s , maximum percentage error in the energy is :",
