    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "Match the List - I with List - II | List - I | | List - II | (A) | Pressure varies inversely with volume of an ideal gas. | (I) | Adiabatic process | (B) | Heat absorbed goes partly to increase internal energy and partly to do work. | (II) | Isochoric process | (C) | Heat is neither absorbed nor released by a system. | (III) | Isothermal process | (D) | No work is done on or by a gas. | (IV) | Isobaric process | Choose the correct answer from the options given below:",
