    "questionEn": "A radioactive nucleus n 2 has 3 times the decay constant as compared to the decay constant of another radioactive nucleus n 1 . If initial number of both nuclei are the same, what is the ratio of number of nuclei of n 2 to the number of nuclei of n 1 , after one half-life of n 1 ?",
