    "questionEn": "A force f = x 2 y i ˆ + y 2 j ˆ acts on a particle in a plane x + y = 10 . The work done by this force during a displacement from ( 0 , 0 ) to ( 4 m , 2 m ) is _________ Joule (round off to the nearest integer)",
