    "questionEn": "If A and B are two events such that P ( A ∩ B ) = 0.1 , and P ( A ∣ B ) and P ( B ∣ A ) are the roots of the equation 12 x 2 − 7 x + 1 = 0 , then the value of P ( A ̄ ∪ B ̄ ) P ( A ̄ ∩ B ̄ ) is :",
