    "questionEn": "Let α , β , γ and δ be the coefficients of x 7 , x 5 , x 3 and x respectively in the expansion of ( x + √ x 3 − 1 ) 5 + ( x − √ x 3 − 1 ) 5 , x > 1 . If u and v satisfy the equations α u + β v = 18 , γ u + δ v = 20 , then u + v equals :",
