    "questionEn": "Let the distance between two parallel lines be 5 units and a point P lie between the lines at a unit distance from one of them. An equilateral triangle P Q R is formed such that Q lies on one of the parallel lines, while R lies on the other. Then ( Q R ) 2 is equal to _________.",
