    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "questionEn": "Let x 2 f ( a 2 + 7 a + 3 ) + y 2 f ( 3 a + 15 ) = 1 represent an ellipse with major axis along y -axis, where f is a strictly decreasing positive function on R . If the set of all possible values of a is R − [ α , β ] , then α 2 + β 2 is equal to :",
