    "questionEn": "Match the LIST-I with LIST-II List-IOrbital | List-IIRadial nodes and nodal plane | A. | 2s | I. | 1 Radial node + two nodal planes | B. | 3s | II. | 1 Radial node + one nodal plane | C. | 3p | III. | 2 Radial nodes + No nodal plane | D. | 4d | IV. | 1 Radial node + No nodal plane | Choose the correct answer from the options given below:",
