    "questionEn": "For the functions f ( θ ) = α tan 2 ⁡ θ + β cot 2 ⁡ θ , and g ( θ ) = α sin 2 ⁡ θ + β cos 2 ⁡ θ , α > β > 0 , let min 0 θ π 2 f ( θ ) = max 0 θ π g ( θ ) . If the first term of a G.P. is ( α 2 β ) , its common ratio is ( 2 β α ) and the sum of its first 10 terms is m n , gcd ⁡ ( m , n ) = 1 , then m + n is equal to _ _ _ _ .",
