    "questionEn": "A lift of mass 1600 kg is supported by thick iron wire. If the maximum stress which the wire can withstand is 4 × 10 8 N / m 2 and its radius is 4 mm , then maximum acceleration the lift can take is _ _ _ _ m / s 2 . (take g = 10 m / s 2 and π = 3.14 )",
