    "questionEn": "A variable X takes values 0 , 0 , 2 , 6 , 12 , 20 , ... , n ( n − 1 ) with frequencies n C 0 , n C 1 , n C 2 , n C 3 , n C 4 , n C 5 , ... , n C n , respectively. If the mean of this data is 60 , then its median is :",
