    "questionEn": "From the point ( − 1 , − 1 ) , two rays are sent making angles of 45 ∘ with the line x + y = 0 . These rays get reflected from the mirror x + 2 y = 1 . If the equations of the reflected rays are a x + b y = 9 and c x + d y = 7 , a , b , c , d ∈ Z , then the value of a d + b c is _ _ _ _ .",
