    "questionEn": "If S = { θ ∈ [ − π , π ] : cos ⁡ θ cos ⁡ 5 θ 2 = cos ⁡ 7 θ cos ⁡ 7 θ 2 } , then n ( S ) is equal to _ _ _ _ .",
