    "questionEn": "Let A = { 1 , 2 , 3 , 4 , 5 , 6 } . The number of one-one functions f : A → A such that f ( 1 ) ≥ 3 , f ( 3 ) ≤ 4 and f ( 2 ) + f ( 3 ) = 5 , is _ _ _ _ .",
