    "questionEn": "Let f : R → R be a differentiable function such that f ( x + y 3 ) = f ( x ) + f ( y ) 3 for all x , y ∈ R , and f ′ ( 0 ) = 3 . Then the minimum value of the function g ( x ) = 3 + e x f ( x ) , is:",
