    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements: one is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason R Assertion A : If the average kinetic energy of H 2 and O 2 molecules, kept in two different sized containers are same, then their temperatures will be same. Reason R : The r.m.s speed of H 2 and O 2 molecules are same at same temperature. Choose the correct answer from the options given below",
