    "questionEn": "A rigid dipole undergoes a simple harmonic motion about its centre in the presence of an electric field E → 1 = E 0 x ˆ . If another electric field E → 2 = 2 E 0 ( y ˆ + z ˆ ) is introduced to the system, what will be the percentage change in the frequency of the oscillation (approximate)?",
