    "questionEn": "A 1 kg block subjected to two simultaneous forces ( 2 i ˆ + 3 j ˆ + 4 k ˆ ) N and ( 3 i ˆ − j ˆ − 2 k ˆ ) N is moved a distance of 25 m along ( 3 i ˆ − 4 j ˆ ) direction. The work done in this process is _ _ _ _ J.",
