    "questionEn": "Let the point A be the foot of perpendicular drawn from the point P ( a , b , 0 ) on the line x − 1 2 = y − 2 1 = z − α 3 . If the midpoint of the line segment PA is ( 0 , 3 4 , − 1 4 ) , then the value of a 2 + b 2 + α 2 is equal to :",
