    "questionEn": "Two point charges 8 μ C and − 2 μ C are located at x = 2 cm and x = 4 cm, respectively on the x -axis. The ratio of electric flux due to these charges through two spheres of radii 3 cm and 5 cm with their centers at the origin is ________.",
