    "questionEn": "Let a, b, c ∈ {1, 2, 3, 4}. If the probability, that a x 2 + 2 √ 2 b x + c > 0 for all x ∈ R , is m n , gcd ( m , n ) = 1 , then m + n is equal to ________.",
