    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "A vessel contains 0.15 m 3 of a gas at pressure 8 bar and temperature 140 °C with c p = 3 R and c v = 2 R . It is expanded adiabatically till pressure falls to 1 bar. The work done during this process is _________ kJ. (R is gas constant)",
