    "questionEn": "The number of isoelectronic species among S c 3 + , C r 2 + , M n 3 + , C o 3 + and F e 3 + is ‘n’. If ‘n’ moles of AgCl is formed during the reaction of complex with formula C o C l 3 ( e n ) 2 N H 3 with excess of A g N O 3 solution, then the number of electrons present in the t 2 g orbital of the complex is ________.",
