    "questionEn": "Let y = y ( x ) be the solution of the differential equation x d y d x − y = x 2 cot ⁡ x , x ∈ ( 0 , π ) . If y ( π 2 ) = π 2 , then 6 y ( π 6 ) − 8 y ( π 4 ) is equal to :",
