    "questionEn": "X is the number of geometrical isomers exhibited by [ Pt ( NH 3 ) ( H 2 O ) BrCl ] . Y is the number of optically inactive isomer(s) exhibited by [ CrCl 2 ( ox ) 2 ] 3 − Z is the number of geometrical isomers exhibited by [ Co ( NH 3 ) 3 ( NO 2 ) 3 ] . The value of X + Y + Z is _ _ _ _ .",
