    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Electricity is passed through an acidic solution of Cu 2 + till all the Cu 2 + was exhausted, leading to the deposition of 300 mg of Cu metal. However, a current of 600 mA was continued to pass through the same solution for another 28 minutes by keeping the total volume of the solution fixed at 200 mL . The total volume of oxygen evolved at STP during the entire process is _ _ _ _ mL . (Nearest integer) [Given: Cu 2 + ( aq ) + 2 e − → Cu ( s ) E o red = + 0.34 V O 2 ( g ) + 4 H + + 4 e − → 2 H 2 O E o red = + 1.23 V Molar mass of Cu = 63.54 g mol − 1 Molar mass of O 2 = 32 g mol − 1 Faraday Constant = 96500 C mol − 1 Molar volume at STP = 22.4 L ]",
