    "questionEn": "Two resistors 2 Ω and 3 Ω are connected in the gaps of bridge as shown in figure. The null point is obtained with the contact of jockey at some point on wire X Y . When an unknown resistor is connected in parallel with 3 Ω resistor, the null point is shifted by 22.5 cm toward Y . The resistance of unknown resistor is _ _ _ _ Ω .",
