    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Iodoform test can differentiate between A. Methanol and Ethanol B. CH 3 COOH and CH 3 CH 2 COOH C. Cyclohexene and cyclohexanone D. Diethyl ether and Pentan-3-one E. Anisole and acetone Choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
