    "questionEn": "Match List - I with List - II. List - IRelation | List - IILaw | A. | ∮E⃗⋅dl→=−ddt∮B⃗⋅da→ | I. | Ampere's circuital law | B. | ∮B⃗⋅dl→=μ0(I+ε0dφEdt) | II. | Faraday's laws of electromagnetic induction | C. | ∮E⃗⋅da→=1ε0∫vρdv | III. | Ampere - Maxwell law | D. | ∮B⃗⋅dl→=μ0I | IV. | Gauss's law of electrostatics | Choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
