    "questionEn": "A 20 m long uniform copper wire held horizontally is allowed to fall under the gravity ( g = 10 m / s 2 ) through a uniform horizontal magnetic field of 0.5 Gauss perpendicular to the length of the wire. The induced EMF across the wire when it travels a vertical distance of 200 m is _ _ _ _ mV .",
