    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "Two blocks with masses 100 g and 200 g are attached to the ends of springs A and B as shown in figure. The energy stored in A is E . The energy stored in B , when spring constants k A , k B of A and B , respectively satisfy the relation 4 k A = 3 k B , is :",
