    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement I : C O N F is the correct order in terms of first ionization enthalpy values. Statement II : S > Se > Te > Po > O is the correct order in terms of the magnitude of electron gain enthalpy values. In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
