    "questionEn": "Electric field in a region is given by E ⃗ = A x i ˆ + B y j ˆ , where A = 10 V / m 2 and B = 5 V / m 2 . If the electric potential at a point ( 10 , 20 ) is 500 V , then the electric potential at origin is _ _ _ _ V.",
