    "questionEn": "7.9 MeV α -particle scatters from a target material of atomic number 79 . From the given data the estimated diameter of nuclei of the target material is (approximately) _ _ _ _ m. [ 1 4 π ε o = 9 × 10 9 Nm 2 / C 2 and electron charge = 1.6 × 10 − 19 C ]",
