    "questionEn": "The electric field of a plane electromagnetic wave, travelling in an unknown nonmagnetic medium is given by, E y = 20 sin ⁡ ( 3 × 10 6 x − 4.5 × 10 14 t ) V / m (where x , t and other values have S.I. units). The dielectric constant of the medium is _ _ _ _ (speed of light in free space is 3 × 10 8 m / s )",
