    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "Inductance of a coil with 10 4 turns is 10 mH and it is connected to a dc source of 10 V with internal resistance of 10 Ω . The energy density in the inductor when the current reaches ( 1 e ) of its maximum value is α π × 1 e 2 J / m 3 . The value of α is _ _ _ _ . ( μ 0 = 4 π × 10 − 7 Tm / A ) .",
