    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "A circular disc has radius R 1 and thickness T 1 . Another circular disc made of the same material has radius R 2 and thickness T 2 . If the moment of inertia of both discs are same and R 1 R 2 = 2 then T 1 T 2 = 1 α . The value of α is _ _ _ _ .",
