    "questionEn": "For the reaction, N 2 O 4 ⇌ 2 NO 2 , graph is plotted as shown below. Identify correct statements. A. Standard free energy change for the reaction is − 5.40 kJ mol − 1 . B. As Δ G ⊖ in graph is positive, N 2 O 4 will not dissociate into NO 2 at all. C. Reverse reaction will go to completion. D. When 1 mole of N 2 O 4 changes into equilibrium mixture, value of Δ G ⊖ = − 0.84 kJ mol − 1 E. When 2 mole of NO 2 changes into equilibrium mixture, Δ G ⊖ for equilibrium mixture is − 6.24 kJ mol − 1 . Choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
