    "questionEn": "Molarity ( M ) of an aqueous solution containing x g of anhyd. CuSO 4 in 500 mL solution at 32 ∘ C is 2 × 10 − 1 M . Its molality will be _________ × 10 − 3 m . (nearest integer). [Given density of the solution = 1.25 g / mL ]",
