    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement (I) : S N 2 reactions are 'stereospecific', indicating that they result in the formation of only one stereo-isomer as the product. Statement (II) : S N 1 reactions generally result in formation of product as racemic mixtures. In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
