    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "An electric field, E → = 2 i ˆ + 6 j ˆ + 8 k ˆ √ 6 passes through the surface of 4 m 2 area having unit vector n ˆ = ( 2 i ˆ + j ˆ + k ˆ √ 6 ) . The electric flux for that surface is _________ Vm .",
