    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement I : The metallic radius of Na is 1.86 A ∘ and the ionic radius of Na + is lesser than 1.86 A ∘ Statement II : Ions are always smaller in size than the corresponding elements. In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
