    "questionEn": "A galvanometer of resistance 100 Ω when connected in series with 400 Ω measures a voltage of upto 10 V . The value of resistance required to convert the galvanometer into ammeter to read upto 10 A is x × 10 − 2 Ω . The value of x is :",
