    "questionEn": "An artificial cell is made by encapsulating 0.2 M glucose solution within a semipermeable membrane. The osmotic pressure developed when the artificial cell is placed within a 0.05 M solution of NaCl at 300 K is ________ × 10 − 1 bar. (nearest integer). [Given : R = 0.083 L bar mol − 1 K − 1 ] Assume complete dissociation of NaCl",
