    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "If three helium nuclei combine to form a carbon nucleus then the energy released in this reaction is ________ × 10 − 2 MeV . (Given 1 u = 931 MeV / c 2 , atomic mass of helium = 4.002603 u )",
