    "questionEn": "A body moves on a frictionless plane starting from rest. If S n is distance moved between t = n − 1 and t = n and S n − 1 is distance moved between t = n − 2 and t = n − 1 , then the ratio S n − 1 S n is ( 1 − 2 x ) for n = 10 . The value of x is __________.",
