    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "The density and breaking stress of a wire are 6 × 10 4 kg / m 3 and 1.2 × 10 8 N / m 2 respectively. The wire is suspended from a rigid support on a planet where acceleration due to gravity is 1 3 rd of the value on the surface of earth. The maximum length of the wire without breaking is _______ m (take, g = 10 m / s 2 ).",
