    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "In a system two particles of masses m 1 = 3 kg and m 2 = 2 kg are placed at certain distance from each other. The particle of mass m 1 is moved towards the center of mass of the system through a distance 2 cm . In order to keep the center of mass of the system at the original position, the particle of mass m 2 should move towards the center of mass by the distance _________ cm .",
