    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Which of the following reactions are disproportionation reactions? (A) Cu + → Cu 2 + + Cu (B) 3 MnO 2 − 4 + 4 H + ⟶ 2 MnO − 4 + MnO 2 + 2 H 2 O (C) 2 KMnO 4 ⟶ K 2 MnO 4 + MnO 2 + O 2 (D) 2 MnO − 4 + 3 Mn 2 + + 2 H 2 O ⟶ 5 MnO 2 + 4 H + Choose the correct answer from the options given below :",
