    "questionEn": "Let { x } denote the fractional part of x and f ( x ) = cos − 1 ⁡ ( 1 − { x } 2 ) sin − 1 ⁡ ( 1 − { x } ) { x } − { x } 3 , x ≠ 0 . If L and R respectively denotes the left hand limit and the right hand limit of f ( x ) at x = 0 , then 32 π 2 ( L 2 + R 2 ) is equal to ___________.",
