    "shift": 1,
    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "Three identical spheres each of mass 2 M are placed at the corners of a right angled triangle with mutually perpendicular sides equal to 4 m each. Taking point of intersection of these two sides as origin, the magnitude of position vector of the centre of mass of the system is 4 √ 2 x , where the value of x is ___________ .",
