    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "The potential energy function (in J ) of a particle in a region of space is given as U = ( 2 x 2 + 3 y 3 + 2 z ) . Here x , y and z are in meter. The magnitude of x -component of force (in N ) acting on the particle at point P ( 1 , 2 , 3 ) m is :",
