    "questionEn": "At 298 K , the standard reduction potential for Cu 2 + / Cu electrode is 0.34 V . Given : K sp Cu ( OH ) 2 = 1 × 10 − 20 Take 2.303 RT F = 0.059 V The reduction potential at pH = 14 for the above couple is ( − ) x × 10 − 2 V . The value of x is ___________",
