    "subject": "Physics",
    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements: Statement I : An AC circuit undergoes electrical resonance if it contains either a capacitor or an inductor. Statement II : An AC circuit containing a pure capacitor or a pure inductor consumes high power due to its non-zero power factor. In the light of above statements, choose the correct answer form the options given below:",
