    "questionEn": "If S = { x ∈ R : sin − 1 ⁡ ( x + 1 √ x 2 + 2 x + 2 ) − sin − 1 ⁡ ( x √ x 2 + 1 ) = π 4 } , then ∑ x ∈ s ( sin ⁡ ( ( x 2 + x + 5 ) π 2 ) − cos ⁡ ( ( x 2 + x + 5 ) π ) ) is equal to ____________.",
