    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "questionEn": "Let w = z z ̄ + k 1 z + k 2 i z + λ ( 1 + i ) , k 1 , k 2 ∈ R . Let Re ⁡ ( w ) = 0 be the circle C of radius 1 in the first quadrant touching the line y = 1 and the y -axis. If the curve Im ⁡ ( w ) = 0 intersects C at A and B , then 30 ( A B ) 2 is equal to __________",
