    "subject": "Chemistry",
    "questionEn": "Given below are two statements : Statement I : Boron is extremely hard indicating its high lattice energy. Statement II : Boron has highest melting and boiling point compared to its other group members. In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :",
