    "questionEn": "Let I ( x ) = ∫ √ x + 7 x d x and I ( 9 ) = 12 + 7 log e ⁡ 7 . If I ( 1 ) = α + 7 log e ⁡ ( 1 + 2 √ 2 ) , then α 4 is equal to _________.",
