    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "questionEn": "Let A = { 1 , 2 , 3 , 4 , 5 } and B = { 1 , 2 , 3 , 4 , 5 , 6 } . Then the number of functions f : A → B satisfying f ( 1 ) + f ( 2 ) = f ( 4 ) − 1 is equal to __________.",
