    "questionEn": "Let S = { M = [ a i j ] , a i j ∈ { 0 , 1 , 2 } , 1 ≤ i , j ≤ 2 } be a sample space and A = { M ∈ S : M is invertible } be an event. Then P ( A ) is equal to :",
