    "questionEn": "Solid fuel used in rocket is a mixture of Fe 2 O 3 and Al (in ratio 1 : 2). The heat evolved ( kJ ) per gram of the mixture is ____________. (Nearest integer) Given: Δ H θ f ( Al 2 O 3 ) = − 1700 kJ mol − 1 Δ H θ f ( Fe 2 O 3 ) = − 840 kJ mol − 1 Molar mass of Fe, Al and O are 56, 27 and 16 g mol − 1 respectively.",
