    "questionEn": "A parallel plate capacitor of capacitance 2 F is charged to a potential V , The energy stored in the capacitor is E 1 . The capacitor is now connected to another uncharged identical capacitor in parallel combination. The energy stored in the combination is E 2 . The ratio E 2 / E 1 is :",
