    "questionEn": "A hydraulic automobile lift is designed to lift vehicles of mass 5000 kg . The area of cross section of the cylinder carrying the load is 250 cm 2 . The maximum pressure the smaller piston would have to bear is [ Assume g = 10 m / s 2 ]",
