    "questionEn": "A body is dropped on ground from a height ' h 1 ' and after hitting the ground, it rebounds to a height ' h 2 '. If the ratio of velocities of the body just before and after hitting ground is 4 , then percentage loss in kinetic energy of the body is x 4 . The value of x is ____________.",
