    "questionEn": "Standard entropy of X 2 , Y 2 and XY 3 are 60, 40 and 50 JK −1 mol −1 , respectively. For the reaction, 1 2 X 2 + 3 2 Y 2 → XY 3 , Δ H = -30 kJ, to be at equilibrium, the temperature will be :",
